    "name": "Builder's Box - FlexPath API",
    "description": "Updated manual endpoint tests for the Builder's Box Spring Boot API. Run Authentication > Login and Capture JWT first; it stores the JWT in the collection-level accessToken variable. Search endpoints use the current PageResult pagination contract. Requests prefixed with [DESTRUCTIVE] modify or delete data.",
